## Interface: 16001
## Title: Patchwerk Forever: Sparkle (Thread)
## Notes: A sparkle and a name on the herb, vein, chest, quest object or corpse with loot you are coming up to, and on the waypoint you follow: sixteen effects, a look and an alert sound for each kind of thing. A wisp carries what you loot into your bag. Works best with the interact key or a gamepad. Needs Patchwerk Forever. Type /sparkle.
